  <name>State Line Campground</name>
  <desc>8 free BLM camping spots with pit toilets. Limited LTE service from solar powered booster station. One of the eight spots is reserved for tent only.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/4761342d-6fe6-46a7-a118-094ccc650227 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
