 <wpt lat="31.9809" lon="-99.8864">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>White Pocket</name>
  <desc>Sleeping place right in front of the White Pocket on the parking. Super quiet, 0 Services. Ideal for morning and sunset photos! In case you are unlucky in the lottery for „the wave“ - this is the place to visit. It is just wonderful here, no permits required, you can stay overnight. Wonder around and enjoy. The last 9 km is deep sand, 4x4 required, high clearance as well. We made it with a Sprinter. It is a remote place.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/c9b41dd2-7631-4fb3-8b9b-063b68013397 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
