 <wpt lat="39.3579" lon="-111.0475">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beverly Beach State Park</name>
  <desc>This is a great campground for a first night on the Oregon coast. It is a very nice State Park campground with great beach access under a highway 101 overpass. A beautiful old growth loop-system campground with full hookups, tent sites (good selection), hot showers, clean bathrooms, but no wifi available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/1b6793a8-b12a-467e-bb51-ec01bf59c709 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
