  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sunset Bay State Park</name>
  <desc>Another night, another campground. Full hookups, hot showers, no wifi. Price: $21/tent site&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/b6197b0a-074c-468e-bf00-5a87b92afb98 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
