 <wpt lat="34.1104" lon="-111.0167">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Clam Beach County Park</name>
  <desc>This is a very small campground for cars and RVs. Paved lot right by the ocean with toilets (a bit scary), and a picnic site. Maximum stay is 3 nights and fees were $30/night. There appears to be a camp host across the road. Verizon good. AT&amp;T good. Water available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/a24a4bf5-4dd6-4ab5-a519-5e4d783d4df4 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
