 <wpt lat="47.8249" lon="-120.6477">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Doran County Park</name>
  <desc>Busy campground on a spit outside of Bodega Bay, CA. Reservations are required for camping due to pandemic. Cost for a basic (no hook-ups) site is $37/night + $4.44 taxes + $9.50 &#34;reservation fee&#34;. $7 if you want to use the dump station. Flush toilets, pay for hot showers, no wifi but good Verizon coverage. Lots of day-use folks on sunny days. Water is potable but tastes salty/bad.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/be696b74-f226-4952-b032-15ae8a11fc89 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
