 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="27.7509" lon="-81.408">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>KOA Chula Vista</name>
  <desc>Stayed dec 30 &amp;31 and paid $50 for the first night. The second night was supposed to be $90 but the super nice staff gave it to us for $65. It was a huge splurge but we had been sick and in rain for a week and just wanted nice facilities. Thus place was amazing! Dare I say even worth the price? Fenced dog park, trails,one mile to the beach, super clean facilities, garbage pickup at your site, tons of activities for kids, pool, hot tub, laundry, store but best of all perhaps THE best staff of any place of any kind we have ever stayed. Every single employee was friendly and efficient and went out of their way to be helpful- truly wonderful.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/43a990b0-5d10-4479-8243-53f47292f895 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="43.1743" lon="-107.1671">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Willard Bay State Park</name>
  <desc>State park with pull through at campsites. $20 per site. Pretty view of the lake. Lots of freeway and train noise. There is a second campground adjacent that has hookups for rvs.&#xA;Note: GPS Coordinates have been updated. Location is now correct: 41.41994, -112.054806. This park in is Utah, just off Highway 15.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/c4241716-4c9c-49de-999a-79f81201b7e9 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
