 <wpt lat="46.9904" lon="-110.224">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Cove at Fish Lake</name>
  <desc>A great spot to go camping for the weekend, rent a boat and go fishing. There are lots of established campsites. Few sites have hookups, be sure to make a reservation if you need them.&#xA;&#xA;$30/h for motorboat, $40/h for pontoon.&#xA;$20 dry camping, $35 with hookups.&#xA;&#xA;showers are coin-operated. Good cell reception&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96eaf2d5-d0d3-4a33-baa3-123c51038146 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
