  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trout Pond Recreational Area</name>
  <desc>Excellent campground with good facilities. Nearby hiking opportunities and very few people in the colder months. Great lake for boating or fishing.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/9862f739-a547-40c7-afed-0a92bc6e0185 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
