  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rocky Gap State Park</name>
  <desc>Great campground open year-round. Most people stay at the casino which is nowhere near the campground. Campground is very peaceful during the colder months. Excellent hiking and recreational opportunities at the site.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8a38f9de-92b9-43b0-8ae7-3fc37d5e4618 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
