  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Patapsco Valley State Park - Hollofield Campground</name>
  <desc>Great campground near Baltimore. Place can be crowded at times, and a little noisy, but all in all good place to stay so close to a populated area. Some good hiking and epic mountain biking nearby.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/80a628a7-242a-4fd3-9310-e1920c675f6d (network required)&#xA;</desc>
