  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Liberty Campground</name>
  <desc>Free. BLM campground at the head of the Liberty / Table Mountain 4WD trail system. Vault toilets that are well maintained. No water or hookups. There are 15 campsites total.&#xA;&#xA;The homeowners a few hundred yards east on Liberty Road sell ice.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/f3c04fec-bebd-4b95-88b1-4ca88b2b6bd4 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
