  <name>South Ruby Campground</name>
  <desc>$15 per camping unit. Nice views.&#xA;I’m April of 2025 I found the sites to be $8 per night. I was the only one here so super quiet and clean. Never saw the pit toilets but there are toilets down on Browns Dike.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/0a11cbbf-d5a2-483e-9fe0-65c0f803d736 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
