  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mountain View RV Ranch</name>
  <desc>Close to the border, former KOA, friendly staff. $29 plus tax for full hook up. Spent the evening watching Monday night football on the aging big screen TV with the camp host Charles. Also available is propane, small store with beer, and coin op laundry.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/936f4079-28b8-40c4-b811-67a81f399d55 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
