 <wpt lat="27.9108" lon="-81.2078">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Guajome Regional Park</name>
  <desc>Cheapest camping you will find anywhere near Carlsbad or San Diego, and we didn&#39;t need reservations in the summer (everywhere else is full). Extremely clean, pay hot showers, full hookups. Now $29 USD.&#xA;&#xA;Tent, RV, van, camper trick, CABIN Available! Established city run &amp; maintained park with full hookups, dump station, recreation abound! Booked 2 nights, will update upon stay!&#xA;&#xA;Park office 760-724-4489 reservations 877-565-3600&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/45ca23d2-3b0b-4ae6-814a-97f6c4c8dd45 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
