  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Essence Of Tranquility</name>
  <desc>Hot tubs (artesian) and camping or cabins. Also a communal kitchen and Rec room. Fee includes soaks, showers, use of facilities. Super highspeed wifi for those who work remote&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/9975a9d8-acce-4eb9-aa30-6dbc8cea66f6 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
