 <wpt lat="47.1503" lon="-110.0238">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Mill Casino &amp; RV Park</name>
  <desc>This casino is just outside of Coos Bay, Oregon, and has RV park camping ($65+/night). The RV camping has nice paved spots with a bit of green space and picnic tables. Water and Electricity is available at each RV spot. There are nice clean washrooms, showers, and laundromat with access to the hotel pool and hot tub, and a small frontage store selling bare essentials. Restaurants are in the Casino, and be sure to check the local deals at the casino restaurants as they have different buffets a couple times a week.&#xA;&#xA;T-Mo Reception: 3bars &amp; LTE (fast)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/047fe60f-b7d8-4c9d-b0d3-b9b3ce6626fe (network required)&#xA;</desc>
