 <wpt lat="37.0981" lon="-119.0175">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trailers Inn RV Park</name>
  <desc>Stayed in 31-S which fits up to 20 feet. USD 46.30 for full hook up. Wifi is now upgraded so was fast. Don’t expect friendly reception. rest was okay being only 12 miles from downtown price is for the location not view. Small book exchange, TV room next to office. Toilets clean.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/aff9edad-60c7-4ba9-8f57-3ac4ed7d54c8 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
