  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Magnolia Springs State Park</name>
  <desc>Primitive, prepared and RV sites available. Full capability cabins are available. See website for nightly cost (2014 cost $20 for tent walk in and $28 for site with electric).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/5c522a02-c276-48d2-bc36-699fb28942a6 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
