 <wpt lat="39.6777" lon="-110.6471">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crazy Horse Campground</name>
  <desc>Crazy Horse RV Resort is a clean, full-service RV park located in the heart of Kanab, Utah — the perfect basecamp for exploring Southern Utah’s most popular destinations, including Zion National Park, Bryce Canyon, Coral Pink Sand Dunes, and the Grand Canyon North Rim.&#xA;&#xA;We offer spacious full-hookup RV sites with 30/50 amp service, along with tent sites, a heated swimming pool, clean bathhouse, and 24/7 laundry facilities. Our location provides easy access to downtown Kanab, local UTV trails, hiking, and sightseeing.&#xA;&#xA;In addition to RV and tent camping, we offer unique lodging options including Luxury Conestoga Wagons, Yurts, and spacious Apartments large enough for the whole family, making Crazy Horse a great option for groups traveling together.&#xA;&#xA;Whether you&#39;re staying for a night or planning a longer visit, Crazy Horse RV Resort offers comfort, convenience, and a central location for exploring everything Southern Utah has to offer.&#xA;&#xA;Pull-Through RV Sites&#xA;Daily: $59.95 + tax&#xA;Weekly: $359.70 + tax&#xA;&#xA;Back-In RV Sites&#xA;Daily: $55.00 + tax&#xA;Weekly: $330.00 + tax&#xA;Monthly (Oct–Jan Only): Starting at $795 – $895 + electric&#xA;&#xA;Tent Pricing: $30.00 Per Night + Tax&#xA;&#xA;Dumping Station: $10 Dump Only / Dump and Water $30&#xA;&#xA;Bathhouse: Showers are $10&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/b36eb4ad-0fc0-48a5-929a-024e62ec5b78 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
