 <wpt lat="39.5501" lon="-105.7821">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Anza Borrego - NICE</name>
  <desc>Free camping in Anza Borrego Park. Great stop along the highway - the sites are tucked away enough so the traffic noise is minimal. Sites are well dispersed and private with fire rings and pit toilets. Beautiful desert scenery with diverse landscape. Decent cell phone coverage.&#xA;&#xA;You can drive in with 2WD but need 4WD to get the spots further in. Appears to be gravel with not too much difficulty with 2WD. We almost got our ProMaster stuck. Be careful!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/f7e51838-269d-46c6-8b15-2e171a3a8498 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
