 <wpt lat="34.0612" lon="-111.0783">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Spencer Hot Springs</name>
  <desc>Sweet hot springs with 3 pools. Lots of places for vehicle or tent camping with good views.&#xA;Several pools, the one in the center can be somewhat adjusted temperature- wise.&#xA;Roads leading fhere are 2wd dirt roads and should be easy unless wet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/2956a418-17e9-4b40-9831-0e579dc7fd6d (network required)&#xA;</desc>
