 <wpt lat="47.7757" lon="-120.7093">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Burr Trail - NICE</name>
  <desc>Very quiet sleeping places on the Burr Trail to Boulder on a BLM road. Only saw trucks and vans as road is extremely uneven. RV 24 ft max due to the overhang at the entrance.&#xA;&#xA;Tons of good camping off the Burr Trail once you&#39;ve entered Grand Staircase-Escalante. All BLM. Just dirt roads and fire rings. There is vegetation and hills so still very private. It&#39;s sandy — use caution if it&#39;s rainy, the clay turns to butter.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/bea1a520-07fa-4bab-a369-37f1e2141bdf (network required)&#xA;</desc>
