  <name>Coral Pink Sand Dunes - OK</name>
  <desc>Free camping without nothing in the BLM area. But you can also everywhere else camped nearby! Price: Free&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/365ae548-053f-4064-a19f-95ae29877eac (network required)&#xA;</desc>
