  <name>Egan Creat Trail System Recreation Area</name>
  <desc>Recreation Area with NO &#34;no camping&#34; or &#34;no overnight&#34; signs. Although right off the highway, it&#39;s pretty quiet. 2 shelters with tables and garbage cans. A couple of trails to hike, OHV or MTB.&#xA;Free&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/1ae93933-42a2-4603-98da-2a43cd690474 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
