  <name>Salton Sea - OK</name>
  <desc>Sleeping place behind a palm tree at the Salton Sea. You can sleep anywhere here beside the road. Is not especially beautiful, but good starting point for the Salton Sea bird watching.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/ae0329e0-01d5-4110-a960-2d2ab5002dcd (network required)&#xA;</desc>
