  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Schlafplatz vor Vegas - OK</name>
  <desc>Sleeping place on a gravel road just before Vegas in NF. One has to go back there since before the site belongs to a camp. Was very quiet, even when not specifically just beautiful. Weak cell signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/2d2b3ab0-9e7d-42c2-9637-9be9b56c4eb7 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
