 <wpt lat="36.889" lon="-119.2793">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Smokey Mountain Rd - NICE</name>
  <desc>Very nice place on top of the cliff with great views! Large area with awesome view, fire ring. Permit for overnight stay is not necessary.&#xA;&#xA;Smokey Mountains Road/Kelly Grade to this point is in sections very steep, but a great experience. Don&#39;t attempt too soon after rain storm as road can get slick. Curvy shelf road all the way to top of Kelly Grade.&#xA;&#xA;Quiet and beautiful. Certainly often windy, but luckily there&#39;s no wind at night. Weak signals.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/a17a4ff7-5a2b-4508-87ee-c32d812c0373 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
