  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>BLM Free Camping West of Zion</name>
  <desc>Sleeping place just off the main road on well marked road. Big rigs welcome. Warm according to circumstances but quiet at night. Verizon decent, good t-mobile. Good 5G internet on my phone.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/e4e858f4-1965-4d5c-9f00-8728eb47dfd4 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
