  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>National Forest Outside Durango</name>
  <desc>Free. Great quiet camping in canyon next to river. National forest. At end of First Fork road (12 miles on a good dirt road), a few miles east of Durango on the way to Pagosa Springs. Trails.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/aacb1215-c5fc-47b7-99ba-a0d020628325 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
