  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>National Forest outside Glenwood Springs</name>
  <desc>Free. National Forest camping off a dirt road, with good views in all directions. Quiet, only sound you hear are distant cows. No facilities.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8ebad945-50bd-45c8-ba11-b9d4136a0fc5 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
