  <name>Near Robsons Mining World</name>
  <desc>Permits needed for overnight stay.&#xA;&#xA;A desert camping location that is tucked back in the trees. Dry camp. The nearby attraction has a restaurant with limited hours. Interesting glimpse into mining life.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/6066245c-779f-4b60-9b82-05f0dc0a64dd (network required)&#xA;</desc>
