  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Agua Fria National Monument</name>
  <desc>Lots of areas for off road camping with solitude. Road starts off easy, but 4wd / high clearance needed further on &amp; on side roads. Bloody Basin exit off I-17. Archaeological site too that you can walk around.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/4bc0f736-1f30-4915-93d9-9a57bb15a2ea (network required)&#xA;</desc>
