  <desc>Open camp sites in the middle of a tall pine forest. About 5 minutes off Lake Mary Road. Huge open areas with lots of places to choose from. Some spots have rock fire pits.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/398780da-251d-4741-b3dc-348f252797c2 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
