  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sand Wash Wild Horse Area</name>
  <desc>Free camping in the middle of the Sand Wash Wild Horse area. No facilities, BLM land. This spot is next to a small natural pond where lots of wild horses and other animals like pronghorn come to drink.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/d947df5e-2426-4286-ac97-058712e2abef (network required)&#xA;</desc>
