  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Flying J</name>
  <desc>A great last stop in USA before crossing into Mexico. Free to camp , pay showers ( $12) , internet $ 1.99 for an hour.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/eacb50df-3c5c-459b-94b0-6122195a3a63 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
