 <wpt lat="32.0424" lon="-99.8094">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>New Mexico Welcome Center</name>
  <desc>Free to camp out in their parking lot overnight. Clean bathrooms open all night. Noisy (right by highway) but convenient &amp; free. Water fountain and water bottle filling stations. The welcome center is closed at night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58d27d54-c8b0-4ef3-a30e-cf5760786e4d (network required)&#xA;</desc>
