 <wpt lat="39.4194" lon="-110.9705">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rufus</name>
  <desc>North side of I-84 @ Rufus. Was a CoE Park that apparently got turned over to a county that can&#39;t afford to maintain it. Pit toilet. No water (other than the river.) Paved to the east, sand to the west. Blackberrys in mid/late summer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/73fcb38f-d2b5-4c1e-9bdd-b7737fade5ac (network required)&#xA;</desc>
