  <desc>Free! We stayed at Mc Donalds for free Wifi and saw this little Lake behind the Staybridge Suites. Quiet in the Night, no traffic..&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/926cab35-c0df-4e6c-a20d-2cd605ba4f58 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
