  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>New Orleans Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Behind Basin Street Visitor Centre, walking distance to famous French Quarter. The best place to spend a night if you are totally self-contained as there are no RV facilities. Paid parking: $5/10 hours or $10/24 hours for trucks and vans, $50/24 hours for RVs. Quiet during the night, we felt safe the night we stayed there. Right next to us is the French Quarter RV Resort where campers pay close to $100/night!&#xA;&#xA;Bathrooms available when the Visitor Centre is open (8:30-5:30).&#xA;&#xA;Weekend prices are a bit higher I believe.&#xA;&#xA;Paid $20.35 usd for one day of parking. (24 hours)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/08ca01d7-01bf-42fd-b5ff-e8e7f6708e23 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="47.8864" lon="-120.5707">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Premium Parking Lot Nr. 338</name>
  <desc>It is very difficult to find a good overnight place in the center of New Orleans. We stayed on a parking lot at the edge of the French Quarter for 6 USD for 10 hours in daytime and 15 USD for 12 hours during evening and the night. There is no security. No facilities but surprisingly quiet during night. The only central campground &#34;French Quarter RV Resort&#34; would have cost around 100 USD/night!!! As of 4/2023, price is about $60 for 24 HR period and less for few hours. It was quiet enough at all times with a little traffic noise. Just make sure you get water elsewhere. There is no place to find a spigot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/aec5bc9b-8353-40ed-8645-61c33b81a365 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
