  <name>Little A&#39;Le&#39;Inn</name>
  <desc>Restaurant in Rachel, NV near Area 51 that plays on alien theme. They have for spots with water and electric hookups plus tent camping and dry camping area. Tent and dry camping are free. 4 bars with Verizon.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/c205151f-8b1c-4d71-9418-2465b46236a0 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
