  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Open Door Store/Gas</name>
  <desc>Small store and gas pump in Lowman. Reasonably priced gas, basic gas station necessities and food. You fill up at the pump then pay inside based on how much you fill up. Staff is very helpful and we let them know about this site/app, so if you happen to lose service or someone needs guidance they can help and add great things for this area too! This place helped extend our adventure instead of heading all the way to a further town just to get gas!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/9a441aea-e8b9-4185-8a7c-533d4a088d38 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
