  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Maybell General Store</name>
  <desc>This is a small gas station, has gas, diesel, propane, free air for tires (saved me I cut a tire and was able to plug it in dinosaur and didn&#39;t have my air compressor) this is the first place east of the monument with anything. The store has a little bit of everything food, camping gear, automotive supplies.&#xA;&#xA;Last available gas for many miles if you&#39;re heading north on Hwy 318.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/bafa44f6-c433-4d24-92a3-7b9d75e753a5 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
