 <wpt lat="47.0027" lon="-110.2086">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Northern Oilfield Services</name>
  <desc>This location is open to tourists. We were directed here by the other gas station on the east side of town. When we arrived, other tourists were also filling here as well as workers.&#xA;&#xA;Credit card only.&#xA;&#xA;The machine didn&#39;t read my first card, but read my second card. Another tourist I was here with had the machine read her card on the first try. Just beware.&#xA;&#xA;The pumps are in the shack, the prices are on the pumps and not posted outside. Just look through the windows.&#xA;&#xA;On August 6, regular was $7.99 and diesel was $7.29.&#xA;&#xA;If you want a receipt, you pump your gas and then return to the credit card machine and enter your card again and follow the on screen prompts and it will print a receipt.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/30117a4b-c12f-4ea0-ac4b-dcfd57c467b0 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
