  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Coast Guard Pier</name>
  <desc>Open and working! Súper accesible, really. Just come and park (25c / each 10 minutes, just like in town - using park mobile I had to pay $1.90 hour starting price, maybe try machine perhaps cheaper e.g. 25c). Simple toilet with one WC and one shower. Can control temp - water is hot! 50c each 3 minutes. Just a simple curtain separating from the restroom. All good, clean enough and easy to use.&#xA;&#xA;Coin operated - quarters only. 50c for 3 minutes. 75c for 4 1/2 mins. $1 for 6 minutes.&#xA;&#xA;Posted hours: Open 6am - 7pm (Closed overnight)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/7429d126-68cd-45b3-a1c9-865761900294 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
