  <desc>Recreation Centre with an Indoor swimming pool and showers. $1 per person to just use the showers! Closed Sundays. Call to check the hours since they’re different in winter vs summer. Open approximately 3-8 M-F and Sat 11-6. It’s now $5.00 for a day pass.&#xA;&#xA;Hours as of 5/27/26&#xA;&#xA;5:00am to 10:00pm Mon. - Thurs.&#xA;5:00am to 9:00pm Friday 6 00am to 8:00pm Saturday&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/168417fa-0716-4f91-ba6d-761a9bb96082 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
