  <desc>We refilled our propane tank at USD 2.90 per gallon (Nov 26, 2017). This gas station is open on Sundays and will fill-up your motorhome&#39;s propane tank.&#xA;&#xA;Our tank has an ACME valve connector (or also called QCC [Quick Closing Coupling] or OPD [Overfill Protection Device]). But I&#39;m quite confident that they would be able to handle other valve connectors, such as POL (Prest-O-Lite).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/c4bb4480-cc30-4da2-a147-6a0b5186fc8c (network required)&#xA;</desc>
