  <name>Walasi-Yi</name>
  <desc>This is a store and rest location on the Appalachian Trail near where it crosses US29 at Neels Gap. It is at the approach of Blood Mountain. It will be the closest store in a wilderness area that has many unimproved campsites. Cellphone services is typically available due to the elevation.&#xA;&#xA;The store has camping and hiking equipment, outdoor clothing, books, maps, snacks, prepared frozen foods, and other supplies.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/e8e45d3d-2ecb-435a-8b88-ad4921fb68ba (network required)&#xA;</desc>
