  <name>Bellville Meat Market</name>
  <desc>Seriously the best Texas meat you can get. The place is an institution. Make the detour if cruising along I-10 for some local country hospitality and great food. Known widely for their Summer Sausage, but I can&#39;t get enough of the beef jerky. Also have hot briskett rolls and others available for lunch&#xA;&#xA;Note: We do have a family connection here but you don&#39;t just get announced as one of H.E.B.s top 25 foods in the state if you ain&#39;t any good!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/23c9d0e9-d310-4436-96a9-23e9ab413e81 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
