  <name>MacDonald&#39;s - Moab</name>
  <desc>If you need free Wifi you can park your motorhome in the parking lot and get a good signal. We used the service so we ate here. We can park our 26 feet rv without problems. Just in front of the entrance you can park your vehicle under the tree without disturbing the MacDonald parking.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65c81674-6616-472f-b0e4-ef2f9088a6ad (network required)&#xA;</desc>
