  <desc>The Wayward Traveler&#39;s Inn, Bed and Breakfast, Tea House, Writer&#39;s Retreat and General House of Awesomeness. Run by a writer and avid motorcyclist, we will give any great trekker up to two nights free accommodation. That&#39;s how important supporting the travel community is to us.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/ab1e3944-8b8b-4b0b-8b86-24fa81d6bc5f (network required)&#xA;</desc>
