  <name>Red Rock Country Inn</name>
  <desc>Nondescript Motel in Kanab. In low season we were able to get a double room for 55.00. Apparently in high season (starting in May) the room would cost 130.!!&#xA;There are many RV resorts and campgrounds in this town but since last night the temperature was in the low single digits (C) we decided on hot showers and a heated room.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/aedade59-571a-44e2-b9ab-5122038aa7a1 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
