  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Americano Motel</name>
  <desc>If you should find yourself in Vaughn New Mexico and night is approaching, this clean but dated motel is acceptable, relatively inexpensive accomodations.&#xA;The pool is inoperable but the rooms are spacious with two double beds, hot shower , mini fridge and microwave. They have airconditioning and heat. Next door there is a 24 hour diner (and much more expensive motel)&#xA;We parked our motorcycle right outside our window. $55US + tax for two people&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/38d1da16-2bfa-4e91-a193-d4161580860a (network required)&#xA;</desc>
