  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cedar Rest Motel</name>
  <desc>Great budget motel dor travellers and families! One of the cheapest in the area but strongly recommended! Great place to stay when you want to visit Bryce Canyon and around. Very clean, fresh, renewed. Very kind owners from Fiji. AC, great internet, microwave, TV and fridge. Close to the shops, laundry and gastronomic places. Safe big parking, even for RVs. Breakfast in the morning. 45$ for two people.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/7d8502fa-dfb4-4e28-977f-069911256a3b (network required)&#xA;</desc>
