  <desc>Nice, clean rooms. Best price in town. We checked several hotels/ motels. the Motel 6 wanted to charge $130! This place was $99. Staff is very kind. They are pet friendly.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/db6df9c3-df88-4ddd-bd5f-a35b13630b65 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
