  <desc>Great and not so expensive place to stay in the city. Motel with every convenience. Tv, sat, wi-fi inside, AC, parking, heating, big beds, bathroom, fridge and hot water. Very clean and comfortable. Near you have a gas station and Subway. The small room for two I called for pricing and was told $350.00 weekly.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/b8adfa8c-a2f1-4df4-b986-c7f2f997a622 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
