 <wpt lat="38.9748" lon="-116.2038">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hilton Hotel</name>
  <desc>Super clean hotel, very comfortable beds, great water pressure in the shower. Pet friendly, they even gave my dog a treat bag with a toy and treats in it! Large campers (earth roamer etc.) would fit in the back of the hotel parking lot, but if you had a large rig with a trailer you might have to park someplace else.&#xA;&#xA;Great location for doing the TWVT, or a stop on your way south to the KAT or Overland Expo East. Google maps had strange directions coming I-77 south, it wanted me to pass the exit and come back North? It&#39;s the Mineral Wells exit, you can see the sign from I-77.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/ac7816f3-6171-4e25-a317-d2c4673c0ded (network required)&#xA;</desc>
