  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Caesar‘s Palace Las Vegas</name>
  <desc>The very famous Caesar‘s Palace.&#xA;&#xA;The reason why I put it on here is that they have really good valet parking. Safe and no hight restriction. Self parking is 14ft.&#xA;&#xA;Other than that: enjoy, gamble hard, drink and visit Omnia nightclub.&#xA;&#xA;By the way: Caesar didn’t live there. I asked.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95371116-e251-4d1c-843e-944c1c40e1d2 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
