  <name>Desert Hills Motel</name>
  <desc>Big place with lots of parking no matter what size vehicles. Big rooms for about $50 a night, king size bed, air con, cable tv, fridge/freezer and hot water etc. bit of a luxyry compared to my experience in south america but good value and on historic route 66 too! wiifi is the phone number.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/02e1e144-2cec-40bd-b48a-3e477417d81c (network required)&#xA;</desc>
