 <wpt lat="39.567" lon="-110.7857">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Manago Hotel</name>
  <desc>A very basic accommodation. 45usd two beds with shared toilets (which are reasonably clean). Or 73usd with private toilet , all private rooms have small balconies facing ocean. Rooms only have fan and wifi is free. This place has over 100 year old restaurant on premises which serves delicious food (mains in range of 12-15usd), pancakes are huge fluffy size of a side plate worth trying. There is also a taco truck down the road, few fruit shops and supermarket 10 minutes of walking distance. We stayed here 3 nights on the way back from overland trip in usa. Having a rental car made it convenient as 20 minutes to kona where we dived and few snorkeling places within 10 minutes of drive. Volcano np is 2 hours drive towards hilo but it was closed due to hightened activity. Nice drive.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/e854ce0b-099b-496c-996b-ad1353ee6d18 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Hotel</type>
  <extensions>
