  <desc>Great place to stay right on the TransAmerica Trail, right before exiting Oklahoma. Owners are kind and accommodating. Rooms are themed and comfortable. $70 a night for a room. They also allow camping on their property. Has a park for kids to play.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/6f3dd4a9-0107-445a-9330-5570c8ceb021 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
