  <name>Backslope brewing</name>
  <desc>In a industry now over saturated in mediocrity this brewery stands out. Great beers at a cheap price $4, and very good food. (Try the ginger pork sand which with fries ($10). This place is very good and should be visited while you come and go from Glacier. Stands apart from most/all of the other Montana breweries we&#39;ve been too!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/296f9e6f-0268-4e51-93c8-c098fc1c9c85 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
