  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Ohana Family Cafe</name>
  <desc>A must-stop. The best small-town America experience we&#39;ve had to date... Excellent pulled pork, delicious BBQ sauce and a delightful variety of yummy pies. The staff and owners are lovely and made us feel extraordinarily welcome. On top of bottomless cups of coffee, there is reasonably fast wifi (no mobile service here). Highly recommend: Roel (from Holland): &#34;The best place I&#39;ve eaten at in the US.&#34; :) Lots of free wild camping options between here and the Very Large Array.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/6674dee5-e84a-46b1-ba03-3a8d2230b28b (network required)&#xA;</desc>
