  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Paradise bar and grill</name>
  <desc>best food we&#39;ve had in weeks. open air bar and restaurant... decent prices, live music, nice bartenders, clean bathrooms. had a blackened mahi basket,(12.95) smuggled in our own booze and stayed in the parking lot right on the water. even a tiny dog park here too but no dogs in the bar. &#34;no dogs&#34; seems to be the Mantra for Pensacola beach sadly. enjoy!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/4a2aba1a-5bfd-4c7f-a399-cddb2c328a8f (network required)&#xA;</desc>
