 <wpt lat="43.9886" lon="-120.3232">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ziggy&#39;s Roadside BBQ</name>
  <desc>This is a simple place where you order at the counter then seat yourself, but they serve up the best BBQ we&#39;ve ever had. I was worried when the meal came served on a foam plate with plastic utensils, but the the ribs, the brisket, and turkey were all so tender they fell apart with the lightest touch of the fork. The BBQ sauce had the perfect balance of tartness and. sweetness, and we ended up with a plate full of perfection. This place is a &#34;must stop if you like BBQ!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/1b338dfb-462c-4dac-900a-737f316ecf22 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
