 <wpt lat="38.8764" lon="-116.327">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hobo Hot Springs (&amp; Showers by Donation) Saratoga</name>
  <desc>Hot pools, free use, open 24 hours. The bath house is complete with showers and restroom facilities (although the restrooms have no doors, at least on the ladies&#39; side).&#xA;&#xA;No potable water, so bring your own.&#xA;&#xA;Pools range from extremely hot (116°) to pretty cool (100°). Daily temps written on board at bath house. Swimsuits required.&#xA;&#xA;http://saratogachamber.info/play-here/things-to-do/mineral-hot-springs/&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3bbb0f36-7cbb-4e10-8ddc-f2dd98428486 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
