 <wpt lat="44.1543" lon="-114.6342">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Holtville Hot Springs (camping)</name>
  <desc>This is a FREE hot springs with two or three pools and a shower. Frequented by area campers.&#xA;There is a parking lot with &#34;no overnight&#34; posted. But several areas nearby where overnight parking would not be noticed. Just check the dirt roads nearby and along the canal. There is also a campground across the street but we did not check details.&#xA;The hot spring parking area has pit toilets, concrete surrounding, shade, seating. Used all day and through the night. Bring flashlights at night.&#xA;This is alongside Hwy 8 at Vanderlinden Exit. This is accessible by all vehicles.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/23bcf652-1d90-4392-a260-8d208ee161c8 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
