  <name>Gila Cliff Dwellings National Monument</name>
  <desc>Free. Open 9-4. Two hour travel time from Silver City plus exploring, leave Silver City before 1 at the latest or don’t bother. Plenty of camping opportunities on the way.&#xA;&#xA;Amazing place to see how people built structures inside Cliff Dweller Canyon&#39;s natural cave.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/ceb502a4-03f8-49b8-9cb4-789fd38ef7a9 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
