  <name>Spider Rock</name>
  <desc>Spider Rock lookout is 100m from here. Large parking for all size vehicle, small track to walk out and see the STUNNING vista, with the Spider Rock monument. We were here in winter, it was snowing and absolutely magical. The roads are kept clear to drive with ease.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/03d56477-44b7-4195-a060-bd7a5275ecc8 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
