  <name>Carlsbad Caverns - Visitor Center and Entrance</name>
  <desc>This is the carlsbad caverns visitor center and the location where you enter the cave.&#xA;$15 usd (per person) to enter or by anual pass 80,00(one year) if are going to anothers national parks.&#xA;&#xA;You can take an elevator down to the main cave, or you can do a hike through the natural entrance. The hike in and out takes you 750ft. up/down in about a mile, but it&#39;s a comfortable hike in the cool cave temperature.&#xA;beautiful caves, very developed with lights and trails, but amazing none the less!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/0afa21c7-0015-4255-a94b-17eeb884f66f (network required)&#xA;</desc>
