  <name>Danbury Hospital</name>
  <desc>Level 2 trauma center. ER entrance is in the back of the hospital off Hospital Ave right before an open field. there is limited outside parking which is usually filled by midday but there is a parking garage with 7&#39;-0&#34; clearance. There are also some smaller parking lots across the street. valet parking is available. Ambulances use same driveway to drop off patients so keep an eye out for ambulances coming in and out. their drop of area is past the ER parking lot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/f457b30c-babf-4740-a3ae-c4b96712ab5c (network required)&#xA;</desc>
