  <name>Devon Dog Park and Greenland Open Space</name>
  <desc>Devon Dog Park Fantastic off the leash dog park right next to GreenLand Open Space , with a Trailhead for hiking, riding horses Xcoountry skiing , mountain biking , have a b-q. It is close to the highway and a railroad tracks, good place to take dog out , get fresh water , stretch your legs. Has super oversized pit toilets . Not sure if you can stay overnight call the number on website , I’m sure if you got in late and kept quiet for a night no one would care , people were super nice&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/c3ae1df7-a10c-4394-a4ca-08628a22b29a (network required)&#xA;</desc>
