  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ortiz Dog Park</name>
  <desc>This dog park is over 100 acres of trails, and land for your dog to roam freely. It is an off leash dog park (you can still leash your dog) with no fence but clear perimeters of where the park ends. This is a must go to with your dog, the views from the trails are insane and your dog will make lots of friends! It’s open from 6AM-10PM and has an amazing view of the sunset.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/4035825d-90e8-4d24-9807-1f640207f66e (network required)&#xA;</desc>
