  <name>Walton Rocks</name>
  <desc>Awesome dog beach along Florida’s east coast. It is really hard to find anywhere to take your dog to the beach along this coast but this one is great. It is also an OFF LEASH beach so your dog can run and play with friends, play some fetch or go for a swim in the ocean. What a great place for the dogs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/33381875-4b39-44dc-8903-21ee4033ecb3 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
