  <name>Village of Ruidoso Dog Park</name>
  <desc>Two fenced areas on a slope with trees for shade and many nice benches to rest on. The people were very friendly and attentive of their dogs. There was hardly any poop on the ground, either!&#xA;There’s also an area of blue bins to drop off recycling, right there in the parking lot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/83e39862-959f-472a-9832-ac7600d34345 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
