  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Las Cruces Dog Park</name>
  <desc>There are two areas for dogs at this dog park. One smaller area for “special needs” dogs and a large area for all others. There is no grass, but the dogs don’t seem to mind. This is one of the best dog parks I’ve taken my pooch to. It’s maintained by a coalition of members who care about this park, and it shows. Very little, if any, poop to watch out for, lots of trees and shade, benches and chairs galore, water buckets with fresh water all over, and even a big light if you need to come after dark!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/71078e3f-90d8-45c5-846a-41024599cd94 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
