  <name>Dog Park NOLA City Park</name>
  <desc>If you travel with your dog, this is a great place to visit. The park is separated into areas: one for big dogs and one for small dogs.&#xA;My dogs loved it. Several people come here daily to play with their dogs freely. Good place to make good friends.&#xA;Payed U$10 for one week in the administration of the park.&#xA;Clean bathrooms and a place to bath the dogs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/cfd600ca-138f-43d3-9b68-092946711d81 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
