  <name>The Stock Doc (Best Vet ever)</name>
  <desc>We went to The Stock Doc to get the third round of vaccines for our puppy and they where so nice, prices are very reasonable, 20 for a vaccine. They offered us coffee and we could use their bathroom. Very nice people and place, I highly recommend if you&#39;re looking for a vet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Parking: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/2e4da694-8211-48c9-b5f3-7d1c038e49de (network required)&#xA;</desc>
